DESCRIPTION:The Cullman Regional Foundation Dr. Herman C. Ensor Lights of 
 Love Ceremony is Tuesday\, Dec. 8 at 6 p.m. in Christ Hall at St. John's 
 Evangelical Protestant Church. Gifts of $20 or more place a light on the 
 Cullman Regional Christmas tree in honor or memory of someone\, with dona
 tions received by Dec. 4 included in the ceremony. This year's program ho
 nors hospice patients and retired surgeon Dr. Donald Marecle. Time: 6:00 
 PM. Admission: Open to the public\; lights on the tree start at a $20 gif
 t. https://cullmantimes.com/2026/11/06/lights-of-love-ceremony-returns-de
 c-8/
